msgid "U575 retained elapsed-time domain"
msgstr "U575 保留经过时间域"

msgid "`Nexus::U575RetainedTime` provides an explicit elapsed clock for the exact STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 baremetal reference. It reads an externally prepared retained RTC without changing hardware. It does not enter a power mode, restore clocks, provide LPBAM or prove physical Stop2 continuity. The original {download}`IO-32 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` and {download}`SOC-35 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` exits remain open; physical HIL is `not_executed`."
msgstr "`Nexus::U575RetainedTime` 为精确 STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 baremetal 参考提供显式经过时间时钟。它只读取由外部准备并保留的 RTC，不改变硬件。它不进入电源模式、恢复时钟、提供 LPBAM，也不证明物理 Stop2 连续计时。原始 {download}`IO-32 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` 与 {download}`SOC-35 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` 退出条件仍开放；物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。"

msgid "![FIG-24: current explicit retained-clock and Stop2 ownership, wake effects and failure retention; dashed autonomous and physical exits remain open](../assets/diagrams/u575-retained-stop2.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-24：当前显式保留时钟与 Stop2 所有权、唤醒效果及失败保留；虚线自主传输和物理退出条件仍开放](../assets/diagrams/u575-retained-stop2.svg)"

msgid "FIG-24: current explicit retained-clock and Stop2 ownership, wake effects and failure retention; dashed autonomous and physical exits remain open"
msgstr "FIG-24：当前显式保留时钟与 Stop2 所有权、唤醒效果及失败保留；虚线自主传输和物理退出条件仍开放"

msgid "FIG-24 separates the independent RTC domain from the drained RUN domain. Solid arrows name current calls, admission or cleanup transitions; dashed arrows name external source premises and open exits. Hardware drain does not repair a tainted clock. The separately selected Stop2 owner supplies WUT and restoration; the read-only clock component alone supplies neither. No arrow establishes physical residency, automatic enrollment or LPDMA support."
msgstr "FIG-24 将独立 RTC domain 与已排空 RUN domain 分开。实线箭头标记当前调用、准入或清理迁移；虚线箭头标记外部源前提及开放退出条件。硬件排空不修复受污时钟。另行选入的 Stop2 owner 提供 WUT 与恢复；只读时钟组件本身不提供这些机制。任何箭头均不建立物理驻留、自动登记或 LPDMA 支持。"

msgid "Select one RTC owner"
msgstr "选择唯一 RTC owner"

msgid "Use the public [retained-time header](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_retained_time/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_retained_time.h) and link `Nexus::U575RetainedTime` explicitly. The optional target exists only for U575 baremetal single-state builds with no polling AlarmA `[rtc.*]` factory selection. It is not a generated factory, global Core clock replacement or runtime registry. Vendor types stay private; state uses one zero-initialized caller-owned `nx_stm32u575_retained_time_storage_t`."
msgstr "使用公共[保留时间头文件](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_retained_time/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_retained_time.h)，并显式链接 `Nexus::U575RetainedTime`。可选目标仅在 U575 baremetal 单一状态装配且未选入轮询 AlarmA `[rtc.*]` factory 时存在。它不是生成的 factory、全局 Core 时钟替代物或运行期注册表。厂商类型保持私有；状态使用一个清零初始化、由调用方拥有的 `nx_stm32u575_retained_time_storage_t`。"

msgid "For a source consumer, select the maintained [empty assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/nucleo-u575-baremetal-empty.toml), add Nexus as a subdirectory and link the component:"
msgstr "源码 consumer 选择受维护的[空装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/nucleo-u575-baremetal-empty.toml)，将 Nexus 作为子目录加入并链接组件："

msgid "The [public C11 consumer](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/consumers/u575-retained-time.c) shows explicit construction, a face read, a checked sample after Platform stop and joined clock stop. This link fixture supplies no oscillator setup or PCB facts. A Board and boot owner must independently establish the source below."
msgstr "[公共 C11 consumer](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/consumers/u575-retained-time.c) 展示显式构造、face 读取、Platform 停止后的受检 sample，以及 join 后的时钟停止。这个链接夹具不提供振荡器设置或 PCB 事实。Board 与 boot owner 必须独立建立下述源条件。"

msgid "Prepared source and access boundary"
msgstr "预备源与访问边界"

msgid "External boot owns a valid raw BCD 24-hour calendar, `PRER=127/255`, `BYPSHAD=1`, 32768 Hz crystal LSE, `RTCSEL=LSE`, `LSEON`, `LSERDY`, `RTCEN` and `RTCAPBEN`. `LSEBYP=0` and drive codes `LSEDRV=10/11` define this conservative profile. ES0499 Rev12 sections 2.2.3 and 2.2.16 affect revision X; Table 3 marks W/U repaired. This reference does not qualify a silicon revision. Section 2.2.1 requires external boot and Board owners to exclude PC13 transitions for crystal LSE on this LQFP part; GPIO reads cannot prove electrical silence. No PCB route, fitted crystal, drive adjustment or oscillator measurement is asserted."
msgstr "外部 boot 拥有有效的原始 BCD 24 小时日历、`PRER=127/255`、`BYPSHAD=1`、32768 Hz 晶体 LSE、`RTCSEL=LSE`、`LSEON`、`LSERDY`、`RTCEN` 与 `RTCAPBEN`。`LSEBYP=0` 及驱动代码 `LSEDRV=10/11` 定义此保守配置。ES0499 Rev12 第2.2.3和2.2.16节影响 revision X；表3注明 W/U 已修复。本参考不建立硅修订版资格。第2.2.1节要求外部 boot 与 Board owner 排除本 LQFP 器件晶体 LSE 模式下的 PC13 跳变；GPIO 读取不能证明电气静默。本参考不声明 PCB 走线、已安装晶体、驱动调整或振荡器实测结果。"

msgid "The caller serializes all lifecycle calls in privileged Thread mode. Initialize and stop require unmasked Thread; sample and wake validation permit incoming PRIMASK 0 or 1 and preserve it. Handler mode, BASEPRI and FAULTMASK are excluded. Before each tuple pair, the shared helper checks the selected effective MSIS range 4, ready MSIS source, equal buses and RTC APB gate. This conservative MSIS4 profile supplies nominal PCLK 4 MHz, above seven times 32768 Hz. RM0456 Rev7 section 63.3.12 discusses that seven-times ratio under shadow mode; the selected BYPSHAD reader instead follows its repeated complete-tuple procedure. The selected profile does not establish a general RTC-write frequency rule. Exclude concurrent clock profile writers. A separate power owner verifies the restored access profile before post-wake RTC access. This component owns no RCC restoration."
msgstr "调用方在特权 Thread 模式串行执行所有生命周期调用。initialize 和 stop 要求未屏蔽 Thread；sample 与 wake validation 允许传入 PRIMASK 0 或 1，并保持该值。排除 Handler 模式、BASEPRI 与 FAULTMASK。共享 helper 在每组 tuple pair 前检查选定有效 MSIS range 4、就绪 MSIS 源、等速总线与 RTC APB gate。该保守 MSIS4 配置提供标称 4 MHz PCLK，高于 32768 Hz 的七倍。RM0456 Rev7 第63.3.12节在 shadow mode 下讨论七倍比率；选定 BYPSHAD 读取器遵循该节完整重复 tuple 规程。此选定配置不建立通用 RTC 写入频率规则。排除并发时钟配置写入者。单独的 power owner 在唤醒后访问 RTC 前验证恢复的访问配置。本组件不拥有 RCC 恢复。"

msgid "Initial alarms, WUTE/WUTIE, RTC status flags or a live RTC IRQ reject before object publication, including when WUT delegation is requested. Binary mode, shift, calibration, source/gate drift or a foreign calendar configuration is excluded. Raw year-00 provenance is external; INITS cannot prove it. Reads need neither DBP nor unlocked WPR. The implementation writes no RTC, RCC, PWR, TAMP, backup, GPIO, interrupt or protection field."
msgstr "初始 alarm、WUTE/WUTIE、RTC 状态标志或活动 RTC IRQ 在对象发布前拒绝，包括请求 WUT 委托时。排除 binary mode、shift、calibration、源／gate 漂移及外来日历配置。原始 year-00 的来源属于外部前提；INITS 不能证明它。读取不要求 DBP 或已解锁 WPR。实现不写 RTC、RCC、PWR、TAMP、backup、GPIO、中断或保护字段。"

msgid "Elapsed samples and independent deadlines"
msgstr "经过时间 sample 与独立 deadline"

msgid "Initialize copies configuration and returns a separate `nx_clock_t`. Its zero point is the first coherent calendar tuple. Samples extend raw 256 Hz ticks through a 36525-day, 100-year cycle using RTC leap arithmetic, including natural 99-to-00 rollover. The tuple reader is shared with the existing RUN AlarmA provider: at most eight complete matching SSR/TR/DR pairs, BCD/range validation and unchanged output on failure. No UTC century or leap-second model is implied."
msgstr "initialize 复制配置并返回独立 `nx_clock_t`。它以第一个一致日历 tuple 为零点。sample 按 RTC 闰年算术在 36525 日、100 年周期内扩展原始 256 Hz tick，包括自然 99-to-00 回绕。tuple 读取器与既有 RUN AlarmA provider 共享：最多八组完整匹配 SSR/TR/DR pair、BCD／范围验证，且失败不改变输出。这不隐含 UTC 世纪或闰秒模型。"

msgid "A successful snapshot binds storage identity, nonwrapping generation, elapsed ticks and `floor(ticks*1000000/256)` microseconds. The 3906.25 microsecond source quantum carries exact fractional quarters across samples; close samples may return equal time. Overflow cannot return the reserved NEVER value or wrap. No Core TIM2 value or timeout is converted into a calendar epoch."
msgstr "成功 snapshot 绑定存储 identity、不回绕 generation、经过 tick 与 `floor(ticks*1000000/256)` 微秒。3906.25 微秒源量子在各 sample 之间精确累计四分之一微秒余量；相邻 sample 可以返回相同时间。溢出不能返回保留 NEVER 值或回绕。任何 Core TIM2 值或 timeout 均不转换为日历 epoch。"

msgid "The caller declares `max_gap_seconds` in 1..86400 and observes within that gap. The complete elapsed interval, including wake latency and recovery, must fit the bound. A nominal WUT period is not a maximum duration if wake fails. Small external calendar settings and missed complete 100-year cycles are not detectable from snapshots; all calendar writers are excluded externally."
msgstr "调用方将 `max_gap_seconds` 声明为 1..86400，并在此间隔内观察。完整经过间隔必须满足该上界，包括唤醒延迟与恢复。若唤醒失败，标称 WUT 周期并不是最长持续时间。snapshot 无法检测较小的外部日历设置或漏过完整 100 年周期；外部必须排除所有日历写入者。"

msgid "`sample` returns `BUSY` after unstable bounded retries without changing the owner or output. Source/configuration loss, an out-of-window/backward observation or exhaustion taints the live epoch permanently. Its output stays unchanged and later samples return `STATE`. The `nx_clock_t` read callback has no error return, so any failed read taints the epoch, retains the interrupt mask, observes `NX_FAULT_PLATFORM` with the reason and parks if the fault observer returns. A stale time value never resumes deadline consumers. Fault observation releases no loan, storage or observer."
msgstr "`sample` 在有限重试仍不稳定后返回 `BUSY`，不改变 owner 或输出。源／配置丢失、越界／倒退观察或耗尽会永久污染当前 epoch。输出保持不变，后续 sample 返回 `STATE`。`nx_clock_t` 读取回调没有错误返回通道，因此任何读取失败都会污染 epoch、保留中断屏蔽、携原因观察 `NX_FAULT_PLATFORM`，若 fault observer 返回则停驻。旧时间值绝不恢复 deadline consumer 的执行。故障观察不释放任何借用、存储或 observer。"

msgid "The independent face remains separate from `nx_time_now_us()`. Default Core TIM2 stop and invalidation behavior is unchanged. End old Core deadlines before Platform stop; never compare them with this elapsed domain. After every copied face, deadline user, observer and delegated wake owner has joined, explicit clock stop closes reads. Reopen advances generation and starts a new zero domain; old numerical deadlines and wake bindings remain invalid."
msgstr "独立 face 与 `nx_time_now_us()` 保持不同 domain。默认 Core TIM2 停止与失效行为不变。在 Platform stop 前结束旧 Core deadline；绝不将其与本经过时间域比较。所有复制的 face、deadline user、observer 与受委托 wake owner join 后，显式 clock stop 关闭读取。reopen 推进 generation 并开始新的零基 domain；旧数值 deadline 与 wake binding 仍无效。"

msgid "Explicit WUT delegation"
msgstr "显式 WUT 委托"

msgid "A NULL `wake_owner` selects read-only RTC exclusivity with quiet WUT and RTC IRQ. A non-NULL stable assembly identity delegates only WUCKSEL/WUTE/WUTIE, WUTR, WUTF/SCR.CWUTF and the RTC vector to that same serialized wake owner. ICSR.WUTWF may change with its bounded WUT operations. The delegate preserves every calendar and source field. Initial construction remains quiet; this capability cannot adopt an unrelated live wake source."
msgstr "NULL `wake_owner` 选择只读 RTC 独占，要求 WUT 与 RTC IRQ 静默。非 NULL 的稳定 assembly identity 仅向同一串行 wake owner 委托 WUCKSEL/WUTE/WUTIE、WUTR、WUTF/SCR.CWUTF 及 RTC vector。ICSR.WUTWF 可以随其有限 WUT 操作变化。delegate 保持每个日历与源字段。初始构造仍要求静默；该能力不能接管无关的活动唤醒源。"

msgid "`validate_wake` compares that identity and the sampled generation without reopening or repairing the clock. It is trusted assembly binding, not a security capability. Source drift taints the clock and returns an observable error before new wake writes. A failed WUT drain keeps the wake owner's effects and clock storage alive until actual recovery and joins. This component alone promises no wake IRQ, WFI, RUN restoration, Stop2, SRAM4 placement or VBAT guarantee. A separate selected power mode must prove which memory retains state; a read-only RUN clock has no SRAM4 admission requirement."
msgstr "`validate_wake` 比较该 identity 与 sampled generation，不重开或修复时钟。它是受信装配绑定，不是安全能力。源漂移污染时钟，并在新 wake 写入前返回可观察错误。WUT 排空失败时，wake owner 的效果与 clock storage 必须保持有效，直到真实恢复及 join。本组件自身不承诺 wake IRQ、WFI、RUN 恢复、Stop2、SRAM4 放置或 VBAT 保证。另行选入的电源模式必须证明哪些内存保留状态；只读 RUN 时钟没有 SRAM4 准入要求。"

msgid "Source basis and verification limits"
msgstr "源码依据与验证限制"

msgid "The source basis is [RM0456 Rev7](https://www.st.com/resource/en/reference_manual/rm0456-stm32u575585-armbased-32bit-mcus-with-trustzone-and-fpu-stmicroelectronics.pdf) sections 63.3.7, 63.3.12 and the RTC register definitions, plus [ES0499 Rev12](https://www.st.com/resource/en/errata_sheet/es0499-stm32u575xx-and-stm32u585xx-device-errata-stmicroelectronics.pdf) sections 2.2.1, 2.2.3, 2.2.16 and 2.19.3. The latter shadow-read erratum uses BYPSHAD plus complete repeated tuples. Official CMSIS U5 headers remain pinned to `624374fa1e21ca195d6f2102ac0caaa50d0ea4c8`; no vendor bytes are modified."
msgstr "源码依据为 [RM0456 Rev7](https://www.st.com/resource/en/reference_manual/rm0456-stm32u575585-armbased-32bit-mcus-with-trustzone-and-fpu-stmicroelectronics.pdf) 第63.3.7、63.3.12节与 RTC 寄存器定义，以及 [ES0499 Rev12](https://www.st.com/resource/en/errata_sheet/es0499-stm32u575xx-and-stm32u585xx-device-errata-stmicroelectronics.pdf) 第2.2.1、2.2.3、2.2.16及2.19.3节。后一项 shadow-read erratum 采用 BYPSHAD 及完整重复 tuple。官方 CMSIS U5 头文件仍固定为 `624374fa1e21ca195d6f2102ac0caaa50d0ea4c8`；未修改厂商字节。"

msgid "The [production source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_retained_time/src/stm32u575_retained_time.c), [shared tuple reader](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/private/stm32u575_rtc_calendar.h) and [GoogleTest/GoogleMock regressions](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/google/u575_retained_time_test.cpp) cover real C11 behavior against external register and fault-observer ports. Development RED/GREEN and M33 public-link receipts establish software behavior for their exact source identities. They do not establish physical time accuracy, LSE drive/electrical behavior, oscillator retention, wake latency, Stop2 current, reset persistence, VBAT continuity or the complete IO-32/SOC-35 exits."
msgstr "[生产源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_retained_time/src/stm32u575_retained_time.c)、[共享 tuple 读取器](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/private/stm32u575_rtc_calendar.h) 与 [GoogleTest/GoogleMock 回归](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/google/u575_retained_time_test.cpp) 通过外部寄存器及 fault-observer 端口检查真实 C11 行为。开发 RED/GREEN 与 M33 公共链接记录为其精确源码身份建立软件行为证据。它们不建立物理计时精度、LSE 驱动／电气行为、振荡器保留、唤醒延迟、Stop2 电流、复位持久性、VBAT 连续性或完整 IO-32/SOC-35 退出资格。"

msgid "Select and use the Stop2 owner"
msgstr "选择并使用 Stop2 owner"

msgid "Link `Nexus::U575Stop2` explicitly alongside the same no-AlarmA assembly. Its [public header](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_stop2/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_stop2.h), [component contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_stop2/README.md) and [public C11 consumer](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/consumers/u575-stop2.c) define the exact STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 baremetal sequence. Initialize the retained clock with `wake_owner=nx_stm32u575_stop2_identity()` and a maximum observation gap covering the full elapsed interval, then initialize the Stop2 owner with that storage and explicit RUN-consumer capacity. Keep the storage alive through both owners and every copied face. Bindings are trusted static assembly, not hardware authentication; another RTC/AlarmA owner cannot coexist."
msgstr "在同一未选 AlarmA 的装配中显式链接 `Nexus::U575Stop2`。其[公共头文件](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_stop2/include/nexus/components/stm32u575_stop2.h)、[组件合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/stm32u575_stop2/README.md) 和[公共 C11 consumer](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/consumers/u575-stop2.c) 定义精确 STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 baremetal 规程。先用 `wake_owner=nx_stm32u575_stop2_identity()` 和覆盖完整经过间隔的最大观察间隔初始化保留时钟，再用该存储及显式 RUN-consumer 容量初始化 Stop2 owner。存储须覆盖两个 owner 和每个复制 face 的生命期。绑定属于受信静态装配，不是硬件认证；其他 RTC/AlarmA owner 不能共存。"

msgid "Enroll every platform and product producer, device, IRQ, DMA, observer and Core deadline consumer in this owner's ClockDomain. Close RUN admission while leases are live, stop Platform/System and join consumers through their actual APIs, then release each lease only after real drain. Pass this exact closed barrier once its enrolled count is zero. The barrier proves enrolled owners only; unenrolled hardware and asynchronous actors remain external obligations. The independent retained clock stays outside this stopped RUN domain. End all old Core TIM2 deadlines; no numerical deadline crosses its stop/restart boundary."
msgstr "将每个平台及产品 producer、device、IRQ、DMA、observer 和 Core deadline consumer 登记到该 owner 的 ClockDomain。在租约仍有效时关闭 RUN 准入，通过实际 API 停止 Platform/System 并 join consumer，然后仅在真实排空后释放各租约。已登记计数为零后传入这个精确 closed barrier。barrier 只证明已登记 owner；未登记硬件与异步参与者仍是外部责任。独立保留时钟位于这个已停止 RUN domain 之外。结束所有旧 Core TIM2 deadline；任何数值 deadline 均不能跨越其 stop/restart 边界。"

msgid "Call enter in privileged MSP Thread with CONTROL=0, PRIMASK=1 and BASEPRI=FAULTMASK=0, before any scheduler has started. Platform/System must be stopped with no residual effects. Entry admits the selected MSIS4/equal-bus and Range4 supply state (`VOS=00`, `VOSRDY=1`, `BOOSTEN=0`, RM0456 section 10.10.4), caches/debug/MPU/SysTick/other IRQ and EXTI sources off, quiet peripheral gates, all SRAM retained and Flash prefetch disabled. Boot supplies the prepared LSE calendar, access gates and DBP=1. Exclude watchdogs, NMI/HardFault agents, other bus masters and concurrent configuration writers externally; zero register fields cannot prove these conditions. The component contract lists the exact exclusions and errata basis."
msgstr "在任何 scheduler 启动前，以特权 MSP Thread、CONTROL=0、PRIMASK=1、BASEPRI=FAULTMASK=0 调用 enter。Platform/System 必须已停止且无残余效果。入口仅接纳选定 MSIS4／等速总线与 `VOS=00`、`VOSRDY=1`、`BOOSTEN=0` 的 Range4 供电状态（RM0456 第10.10.4节），要求 caches/debug/MPU/SysTick/其他 IRQ 和 EXTI 源关闭、外设 gate 静默、所有 SRAM 保留及 Flash prefetch 关闭。boot 提供预备 LSE 日历、访问 gate 与 DBP=1。外部必须排除 watchdog、NMI/HardFault agent、其他 bus master 与并发配置写入者；寄存器零值不能证明这些条件。组件合同列出精确排除条件与 errata 依据。"

msgid "Request 2..65536 RTC/16 ticks at nominal 2048 Hz; the owner programs WUTR=ticks-1 with WUTOCLR=0 after observing WUTWF. The first WUTF assertion lies between WUTR and WUTR+2 counter ticks after enable. RTC samples resolve 3906.25 microseconds, so a short request can report zero elapsed time. `poll_limit` bounds observations in each phase, not elapsed time; WFI has no CPU duration bound if hardware wake fails. The configured retained-clock gap must cover arm, actual sleep/wake latency and drain execution."
msgstr "请求 2..65536 个 RTC/16 tick，标称 2048 Hz；owner 观察到 WUTWF 后设置 WUTR=ticks-1、WUTOCLR=0。首次 WUTF 断言位于 enable 后 WUTR 至 WUTR+2 个 counter tick 之间。RTC sample 分辨率为 3906.25 微秒，因此短请求可以报告零经过时间。`poll_limit` 限制每个阶段的观察次数，不是经过时间；硬件唤醒失败时，WFI 没有 CPU 持续时间上界。保留时钟配置的间隔必须覆盖置备、实际睡眠／唤醒延迟及排空执行。"

msgid "After WFI the owner clears SLEEPDEEP and verifies the selected RUN profile before any RTC read or write. An invalid profile permits core deep-bit clearing and CPU vector withdrawal only; WUT and related effects remain owned until an external reviewed owner restores MSIS4. With a valid profile it observes the wake flag and captures only a same-generation RTC sample. It withdraws the WUT source and IRQ and verifies/restores saved WUTR, MSIK enable state, power and added sleep/autonomous gates before releasing effects. Protected WUT writes use scoped WPR unlock/relock. Every return preserves the incoming masks. `wait_executed` proves WFI ran, not physical Stop2 residency."
msgstr "WFI 后 owner 清除 SLEEPDEEP，并在任何 RTC 读写前验证选定 RUN 配置。配置无效时只允许清除 core deep 位及撤回 CPU vector；WUT 与相关效果保持所有权，直到外部经审查 owner 恢复 MSIS4。配置有效时，它观察 wake flag，并仅捕获同一 generation 的 RTC sample。它撤回 WUT 源与 IRQ，在释放效果前验证／恢复保存的 WUTR、MSIK enable 状态、power 与自增 sleep/autonomous gate。受保护 WUT 写入使用有限作用域 WPR 解锁／重新锁定。每次返回均保持传入屏蔽状态。`wait_executed` 证明 WFI 已执行，不证明物理 Stop2 驻留。"

msgid "Inspect primary, cleanup and remaining-effects results separately. Failed drain keeps RUN admission closed and clock/owner storage alive; do not restart Platform or reclaim a loan. Retry `nx_stm32u575_stop2_recover` at the same masked boundary; it never executes WFI and checks the access profile before RTC operations. Hardware isolation can finish while the clock remains tainted. After real drain and all clock-user joins, clock stop/reopen may establish a new generation; old deadlines stay invalid. Reopen RUN admission and restart Platform only after no effects remain, creating a fresh Core TIM2 epoch. This selected software reference does not provide RTOS Tick compensation, LPDMA/LPBAM, Standby, VBAT continuity or physical retention/power/latency qualification."
msgstr "分别检查 primary、cleanup 与 remaining-effects 结果。排空失败时 RUN 准入保持关闭，clock/owner 存储保持有效；不得重启 Platform 或回收借用。在同一屏蔽边界重试 `nx_stm32u575_stop2_recover`；它绝不执行 WFI，并在 RTC 操作前检查访问配置。硬件隔离完成后时钟仍可能受污。真实排空且所有 clock user join 后，clock stop/reopen 可以建立新 generation；旧 deadline 仍无效。仅在没有残余效果时重开 RUN 准入并重启 Platform，创建新的 Core TIM2 epoch。此选定软件参考不提供 RTOS Tick 补偿、LPDMA/LPBAM、Standby、VBAT 连续性或物理保留／功耗／时延资格。"
